# VHS M1: a portrait camera in the 16:9 picture box: the narrow picture centred, never cropped.
title VHS M1 started with the FineCam's switch in position A (portrait): 1080x1920 in the box, upright, whole
sizes 800x480 480x800
env VHS_FORMAT rgb565
env VHS_FAKE portrait
env VHS_SOC bcm2837

wait 1500
shot 01-portrait
expect text "1080x1920  30 fps"
key esc
expect quit
